<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - Wit Nigel Q2 loss deepens.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Wit Nigel Q2 loss deepens.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-June versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net income from mining	 0.04 vs 0.04</p>
<p>    Capital recoupment	     0.01 vs 0.9</p>
<p>    Clean up and rents	     0.08 vs 0.14</p>
<p>    Net loss			   0.19 vs 0.08</p>
<p>Full name: Witwatersrand Nigel Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said it was continuing with talks for the sale of its other assets.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
